# specific; the two worth merging are recorded in docs/refactoring-backlog.md F3.
linux/scripts/06-packaging/smoke-torch-venv.sh | linux/scripts/06-packaging/smoke-torch-venv.sh | 58 | assert_pinned_versions / assert_app_venv_parity: each gate must read standalone in its own failure output. F1/F2 2026-09-05: 60 -> 58 with this file UNCHANGED -- the agentic-loop split added a ninth owner of two generic shingles, pushing them past the >6-owner idiom cutoff so they no longer count here. The mirror image of the unsuppressions the last two waves recorded; the pair itself is unchanged
linux/scripts/tests/test-disk-guard.sh | linux/scripts/tests/test-disk-guard.sh | 26 | two fixture builders; explicit beats shared in a test that must not hide its own setup
linux/scripts/01-core/disk-guard.sh | linux/scripts/01-core/disk-guard.sh | 20 | keep_n arg validation in the trim and the watch entry points; both are public and validate independently
